# Brand Alignment

Read `.cursor/skills/mr-brij-brand-guide/SKILL.md` when editing copy or contact info.

## Non-Negotiables

- Brand: **Mr. Brij** — community blog for software quality practitioners
- Public surfaces use `site.brand`, `site.tagline`, `site.description` — not maintainer name
- Maintainer identity (`site.maintainer`) only on `/credits/` (noindex, footer easter egg)
- Platform contact links from `site.platform` in footer and public About
- Design: professional & minimal — credibility over flash

## Before Launch

Delegate `brand-alignment-reviewer` for final copy/UI review.
